<header class="ref-head"><span class="hero-ornament"></span><h1 class="research-title">27 December in history</h1><p class="ref-lede">4 events that happened on 27 December, from 537 to 1979.</p></header>
<ol class="day-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><p class="tih-event-year">537</p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Justinian dedicates Hagia Sophia</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Emperor Justinian dedicated the new church of Hagia Sophia in Constantinople, built in under six years. It was the world's largest cathedral for nearly a thousand years and later served as a mosque and a museum.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag tih-tag-profile" href="/empire/byzantine-empire">Byzantine Empire</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hagia-sophia">Hagia Sophia</a></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><p class="tih-event-year">1831</p><h2 class="tih-event-title">HMS Beagle sails with Charles Darwin aboard</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">HMS Beagle left Plymouth on a surveying voyage with the 22-year-old naturalist Charles Darwin. His observations over the five-year journey shaped his later theory of evolution.</p></li><li class="tih-event-card"><p class="tih-event-year">1904</p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Peter Pan opens on the London stage</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">J. M. Barrie's play Peter Pan, or the Boy Who Wouldn't Grow Up opened at the Duke of York's Theatre. Its story of Neverland, Captain Hook and Tinker Bell became a children's classic.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/theatre">Theatre</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/london">London</a></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><p class="tih-event-year">1979</p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Soviet special forces kill Afghanistan's leader Hafizullah Amin</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">As Soviet troops poured into Afghanistan, commandos stormed the Tajbeg Palace in Kabul and killed President Amin. The decade-long war that followed cost hundreds of thousands of Afghan lives.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/afghanistan">Afghanistan</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kabul">Kabul</a></div></li></ol>
